====================================================================
WHAT MUST CHANGE FOR A PASS
====================================================================
corruptSettingsDirToFile (internal/services/retirement/coverage_gaps4_test.go)
and makeSaveFail (internal/handlers/whatif/handlers_test.go) must fail the
SAVE while leaving the LOAD working, as chmod 0500 did. Replacing the
settings directory with a file breaks both. A root-proof injection that
preserves the asymmetry is already in this same changeset: the read-only
bind mount used by makeDirWriteBlocked in
internal/handlers/majorexpenses/coverage_test.go, which mutant (c) proves
still kills a save-swallow under root -- or the NAME_MAX/ENAMETOOLONG
pattern already used in TestRenameScenario_WriteError. Re-verification must
re-run mutation (b) and require the five retirement tests and the ~16 whatif
tests to fail with it at both uids.
